OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who murdered uni housemate
OL,4,Ajailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has been jailed for life with
OL,7,Fa minimum term of 28 years for
OL,8,Fmurdering his university housemate
OL,9,Fafter lying in wait and stabbing him 30
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,12,FZack Coughlan, 23, ambushed Jamie
OL,13,FCollins, 21, in the garden of their
OL,14,Fhome near Bristol on 8 April and left
OL,15,Fhim dying in the alleyway to dispose of
OL,16,Fbloodstained evidence. He called police
OL,17,Feight hours later.
OL,19,FCoughlan had denied murder and a trial
OL,20,Fwas under way at Bristol Crown Court
OL,21,Fbut he changed his plea to guilty on
OL,22,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
