OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who murdered uni housemate
OL,4,Ajailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read in court, Collins'
OL,7,Fstep-mother Lisa Jane Collins said his
OL,8,Fdeath had "affected our family in a
OL,9,Fdeep, lasting and profound way. From
OL,10,Fnow on, we will always be the couple
OL,11,Fwhose boy got murdered".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
